    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="70">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 70</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{CXIIII} Æt twyhyndum were mon sceal sellan to monbote XXX sciƚƚ, æt VI hyndum LXXX sciƚƚ, æt XII hyndum CXX sciƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">For a person whose wer is 200 [the slayer] must give 30 shillings as man-price [to the lord of the slain man]; for [a person of] 600, 80 shillings, for [a person of] 1,200, 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">When a wergeld of 200 shillings has to be paid, a compensation of 30 shillings shall be paid to the man's lord; when a wergeld of 600 shillings has to be paid, the compensation shall be 80 shillings; when a wergeld of 1200 shillings has to be paid, the compensation shall be 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Æt twyhyndum were mon sceal syllan to monbote XXX scll', æt syxhyndum LXXX scll', æt XIIhyndum CXX scll'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
